sh-null", "storyline": "Year 18,406 of the Era of Inheritance. Humanity is long gone. Avel was not destroyed. It was erased: scrubbed from maps, archives and the perception of almost every android by an ancient system called PALIMPSEST. Wanderers dream of it anyway. Those dreams are echoes, and echoes spread.", "summary": "An isometric action MMORPG of androids and erased cities. Wake in Cradle-19 as a Ninth Generation Wanderer, fight machines with blade and Drone, shape your build with Plug-in Chips, and remember the places the world was made to forget. Real-time blade combat with a companion Drone that runs swappable Programs, five Android Types, a Flight Unit war frame, hacking, parties and guilds. Free to play, with cosmetics only in the shop. Formerly known as Crowned Sun.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/echo-slash-slash-null", "videos": [{"id": 203649, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "0PV83Q9RfTA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0PV83Q9RfTA", "title": "ECHO//NULL - Pre-Alpha Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0PV83Q9RfTA/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}